{"slug":"kendrick-perkins-claps-back-at-four-time-champion-draymond-green-we-all-know-you-all-bark-no-bite","postId":74644,"title":"Kendrick Perkins Claps Back At Four-Time Champion Draymond Green, \"We All Know You All Bark No Bite\"","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":516505,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/A5BYMCFVJVHMJDPYERLJ5VFBMA.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-516505\"/><figcaption>Getty Images </figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Draymond Green is not a man who will ever be silent when he quarrels with someone. On the contrary, Green is one of the strongest critics of the modern NBA, whether on the court, in the locker room, or in the media. Green talks his mind as freely as he can, creating fun for the fans, but he wrinkles the feathers of the people he's talking about.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The latest opponent of Green is ESPN analyst Kendrick Perkins. Green has repeatedly named Perkins a clown, first in May during the playoffs and then again after the NBA Finals&nbsp;finished earlier this month. Green also called Perkins an ogre, saying it's him that makes Perk relevant.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Green went into Perkins again in his latest podcast episode, also speaking of analysts such as Skip Bayless.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/LegendOfWinning/status/1541260909007585280?s=20u0026t=9Ukk-PzBbkTDU7u3tKO6tA\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/LegendOfWinning/status/1541260909007585280?s=20&amp;t=9Ukk-PzBbkTDU7u3tKO6tA\n</div><figcaption><br>\"Kendrick Perkins, you act like this clown [Skip Bayless], and it is baffling to me because he could never be you. Do you know why he could never be you? Because he has never done it. You go around acting like him. You don't have to do that, buddy. You played,\" said Green.<br><br>\"You did it; go talk about it. Or can you not? I hope that you can. With all these hot takes you make, you should be able to. You don't have to act like that, man. You went from being an enforcer to coon; how does that happen? At least you acted like an enforcer; I never took you for one.\" <br><br>Perkins caught word of what Green said and hopped on Instagram and responded. <br><br>“Hey, Draymond, you good? The f*** wrong with you? Didn’t you just win your fourth championship? What the fuck you worried about me? For what? You mad. You mad cause I’m doing it my way. And it’s happened to work. I’m doing it my way,” Perkins said.<br><br>“I ain’t gotta do it your way. I’m doing it my way. But look, forget the old media. Forget the new media. I’m gonna stand by the old law, right? And the old law says, Hey man, all that disrespect and all that whole shit or calling somebody a c***, man, you got me f***!”<br><br>“Ain’t nothing a c*** about me. Ain’t no, c***, ain’t none of that straight up. And here’s the thing, right? We all know dog. We all know you all buck in no bike. We know this. The NBA brothers know this. A lot of them that’s talking behind your back with the whispers,” Perkins said.<br>“They know this, they know you not gonna do nothing.<br><br>This is proven. This is facts. We know that. So go on stop with all the tough talk,” he continued, “You could talk about me as an ESPN analyst, you could talk about my takes. You could talk about everything you want to do. I don’t give a fuck about that, but what you not gonna do is you not gonna disrespect me and call me no motherfucking c***.”<br><br>“And I’m gonna stand on that. You talk about standing on something. I’m standing on that. That’s what I’m not gonna be, especially by you. When we all know you not gonna do nothing!” <br><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/Boness305/status/1541459742081564683?s=20u0026t=G7TYIZaP8peFxKMRWm5lXQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/Boness305/status/1541459742081564683?s=20&amp;t=G7TYIZaP8peFxKMRWm5lXQ\n</div><figcaption>Perkins would later <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KendrickPerkins/status/1541459284273291265?s=20&amp;t=G7TYIZaP8peFxKMRWm5lXQ\">tweet out the message</a>, \"I took my post down addressing Draymond Green out of respect for my company and colleagues I work with everyday, but I was heard loud and clear. Happy Monday and carry on…\"<gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></gwmw><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></gwmw></gwmw></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","excerpt":"Getty Images Draymond Green is not a man who will ever be silent when he quarrels with someone. On the contrary, Green is one of the strongest critics of the modern NBA, whether on the court, in the…","publishedAt":"2022-06-27T05:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2022-06-27T05:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"draymond-green","name":"Draymond Green"},{"slug":"espn","name":"ESPN"},{"slug":"kendrick-perkins","name":"Kendrick Perkins"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/A5BYMCFVJVHMJDPYERLJ5VFBMA.jpeg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/A5BYMCFVJVHMJDPYERLJ5VFBMA.jpeg"],"readingTimeMin":3,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/kendrick-perkins-claps-back-at-four-time-champion-draymond-green-we-all-know-you-all-bark-no-bite/"}